CM_ "Inverter frames turned off in the current tune (CAN_ACTIVE_MSGS). Add to the AiM only after enabling them.";
CM_ BO_ 160 "Turned off in the inverter tune, needs its CAN_ACTIVE_MSGS Lo bit set (bit 0). RS3 had this on 0xA2 by mistake";
CM_ BO_ 161 "Turned off in the inverter tune, needs its CAN_ACTIVE_MSGS Lo bit set (bit 1)";
