CM_ SG_ 167 VAB_Vd_Voltage "VAB when disabled, Vd when enabled";
CM_ SG_ 167 VBC_Vq_Voltage "VBC when disabled, Vq when enabled";
CM_ BO_ 169 "Turned off in the inverter tune, needs its CAN_ACTIVE_MSGS Lo bit set (bit 9)";
CM_ BO_ 173 "Turned off in the inverter tune, needs its CAN_ACTIVE_MSGS Lo bit set (bit 13)";
CM_ BO_ 174 "Turned off in the inverter tune, needs its CAN_ACTIVE_MSGS Lo bit set (bit 14)";

